From 9c4c4123c912e0a4fc26c920840b481e6a2a5130 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
Date: Thu, 28 Sep 2023 17:12:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 511/954] feat(stm32mp21): introduce new STM32MP21 flag

To be able to distinguish features between all STM32MP2 variants.
A new compilation flag (STM32MP21) is introduced.
STM32 header version 2.3 is enabled in this case.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 81d6d6f709511a5e3484516b36f15425493fc97e feat(stm32mp21): introduce new STM32MP21 flag]
Signed-off-by: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
Change-Id: I2f56ec376fcabb8800d52baec0440dddee896c2b
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/356304
Tested-by: Sebastien PASDELOUP <sebastien.pasdeloup-ext@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Sebastien PASDELOUP <sebastien.pasdeloup-ext@st.com>
Domain-Review: Sebastien PASDELOUP <sebastien.pasdeloup-ext@st.com>
---
 docs/plat/st/stm32mp2.rst               |  2 ++
 drivers/st/fmc/stm32_fmc2_nand.c        | 12 ++++++------
 drivers/st/mmc/stm32_sdmmc2.c           |  4 ++--
 plat/st/common/bl2_io_storage.c         |  8 ++++----
 plat/st/common/include/stm32mp_common.h |  4 ++--
 plat/st/common/stm32mp_common.c         |  2 +-
 plat/st/stm32mp2/platform.mk            | 25 +++++++++++++++++++++++--
 7 files changed, 40 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/plat/st/stm32mp2.rst b/docs/plat/st/stm32mp2.rst
index 51777d1fff..67b4ae7e8c 100644
--- a/docs/plat/st/stm32mp2.rst
+++ b/docs/plat/st/stm32mp2.rst
@@ -105,6 +105,8 @@ Dedicated STM32MP2 build flags:
   | Default: 1
 - | ``STM32MP_M33_TDCID``: Enable this flag if Cortex-A35 does not have the Trusted Domain Compartment ID (owned by Cortex-M33)
   | Default: 0
+- | ``STM32MP21``: to select STM32MP21 variant configuration.
+  | Default: 0
 - | ``STM32MP25``: to select STM32MP25 variant configuration.
   | Default: 1
 
diff --git a/drivers/st/fmc/stm32_fmc2_nand.c b/drivers/st/fmc/stm32_fmc2_nand.c
